{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy Delivery Co. is a relaxing driving game with <i>definitely</i>\u00a0no secrets. You\u2019ve been hired as a delivery driver in a once-lively scenic mountain town now plagued with inhospitable weather. Make deliveries and uncover the story of the town\u2019s <i>not-at-all mysterious</i> residents, all while earning well below minimum wage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Pick_up.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Driving.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Deliver.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dream of Escaping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Escape.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn a &quot;living&quot; by delivering packages with your kei truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take in the atmospheric scenery or blitz through (road safety not required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy drastically overpriced gas and get to know the locals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls and retro graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to cool beats while driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split-screen race mode with up to four players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing strange going on, no lore, nothing at all, we promise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect in the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of Easy Delivery Co. you will be introduced to the company town where deliveries take place. As a driver, you have to pick up orders and deliver them across various parts of the town. Just be careful of staying outside too long as the freezing temperatures will stop you in your tracks. Explore the town, buy equipment to make exploring easier, and make sure to stay stocked up on gas and energy drinks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592280?t=1745844717","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592280?t=1745844717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/1f49ba1681f0171320e55599d9bcdc224561372f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745844717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/1f49ba1681f0171320e55599d9bcdc224561372f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745844717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy Delivery Co. is a relaxing driving game with <i>definitely</i>\u00a0no secrets. You\u2019ve been hired as a delivery driver in a once-lively scenic mountain town now plagued with inhospitable weather. Make deliveries and uncover the story of the town\u2019s <i>not-at-all mysterious</i> residents, all while earning well below minimum wage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Pick_up.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Driving.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Deliver.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dream of Escaping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592280/extras/Escape.gif?t=1745844717\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn a &quot;living&quot; by delivering packages with your kei truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take in the atmospheric scenery or blitz through (road safety not required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy drastically overpriced gas and get to know the locals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls and retro graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to cool beats while driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split-screen race mode with up to four players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing strange going on, no lore, nothing at all, we promise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect in the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of Easy Delivery Co. you will be introduced to the company town where deliveries take place. As a driver, you have to pick up orders and deliver them across various parts of the town. Just be careful of staying outside too long as the freezing temperatures will stop you in your tracks. Explore the town, buy equipment to make exploring easier, and make sure to stay stocked up on gas and energy drinks.</p>","developers":["Sam C"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3293010","name":"Easy Delivery Co."},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"2